WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.750
Your app emails a sign-in code.

2
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.363
Your test reads it, with no mailbox.

3
00:00:05.363 --> 00:00:09.500
By the end, a test signs in on Android and iOS by itself.

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.121
Tests cannot open your inbox.

5
00:00:13.121 --> 00:00:15.838
So teams share a test account and wait.

6
00:00:15.838 --> 00:00:20.925
In Shipvo, every session has its own private inbox, with its own address.

7
00:00:22.525 --> 00:00:23.177
Step one.

8
00:00:23.177 --> 00:00:24.625
Ask for the address.

9
00:00:24.625 --> 00:00:26.291
The tool is inbox_read.

10
00:00:26.291 --> 00:00:29.550
Type that address into the app's email field.

11
00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:31.803
Step two.

12
00:00:31.803 --> 00:00:32.819
Tap send code.

13
00:00:32.819 --> 00:00:36.012
The app sends its mail to the session inbox.

14
00:00:36.012 --> 00:00:38.625
A mock network rule can send it too.

15
00:00:40.225 --> 00:00:40.962
Step three.

16
00:00:40.962 --> 00:00:42.169
Wait for the mail.

17
00:00:42.169 --> 00:00:45.989
Inbox wait returns the sender, the subject, and the code.

18
00:00:45.989 --> 00:00:48.000
Four eight two nine one three.

19
00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:50.278
Step four.

20
00:00:50.278 --> 00:00:52.243
Type the code and tap verify.

21
00:00:52.243 --> 00:00:54.005
The app says welcome back.

22
00:00:54.005 --> 00:00:55.225
You are signed in.

23
00:00:56.825 --> 00:00:59.590
It works the same on Android and iOS.

24
00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:03.775
Open the session with platform android, or platform iOS.

25
00:01:05.375 --> 00:01:06.783
What if no mail comes?

26
00:01:06.783 --> 00:01:07.807
You do not hang.

27
00:01:07.807 --> 00:01:12.350
You get a typed error, inbox_timeout, and you can read what did arrive.

28
00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:16.308
In a typed test, it is three lines.

29
00:01:16.308 --> 00:01:17.656
Address, send, code.

30
00:01:17.656 --> 00:01:21.025
For a magic link, open the first link in the mail.

31
00:01:22.625 --> 00:01:25.321
Test the sign-in, and skip the mailbox.

32
00:01:25.321 --> 00:01:30.575
Read the guide at shipvo.dev/docs/email-sign-in.
